// The advance healthcare directive of Walter Okafor (directive.md).
Document "directive.md".

Fact person Identified by Walter, Grace, Samuel
Role patient Is Walter
Placeholder agent For person
Fact physician
Input Fact attending Identified by physician
Role committee Is EthicsCommittee
Fact treatment Identified by LifeSupport
Fact choice Identified by Consent, Refuse
Fact ruling Identified by Incapacitated, Capable

// H.1, H.6: in effect, and who the agent is
Bool in-effect
  Holds when Done(sign(Walter)) && !Done(revoke(Walter))
Act sign Actor patient
  Holds when True
Power revoke Actor patient
  Valid when True
Fact out Identified by agent
Act decline Actor agent
  Holds when True
  Creates out(agent)
Event becomes-unable Related to agent
  Creates out(agent)
Power dismiss Actor patient Related to agent
  Valid when True
  Creates out(agent)
Role serving For person First of Grace, Samuel Unless !in-effect || out(person)

// H.3: capacity is a question of evidence, presumed until shown otherwise
Evidenced Bool lacks-capacity Presumed False
Act determine-incapacity Actor physician
  Holds when attending(physician)
  Supports lacks-capacity()
Act disagree Actor physician
  Holds when !attending(physician)
  Rebuts lacks-capacity()
Finding withdraw-determination Actor physician
  Resolves !lacks-capacity()
  Valid when attending(physician)
Finding rule-capacity Actor committee Related to ruling
  Decides lacks-capacity() When ruling == Incapacitated
  Valid when Conflicted(lacks-capacity())

// H.4, H.5: what the agent may choose
Bool terminal
Act diagnose-terminal Actor physician
  Holds when attending(physician)
  Creates terminal
Fact open-to-agent Identified by treatment * choice
  Default agent-chooses Holds when True
  Exception my-instruction Overrides agent-chooses
    Rejects when treatment == LifeSupport && choice == Consent && terminal

// H.2: who decides
Function decision Identified by treatment * choice
Power decide Actor person Related to treatment, choice
  Valid when (patient(person) && !lacks-capacity)
          || (serving(person) && lacks-capacity && open-to-agent(treatment, choice))
  Creates decision(treatment, choice)

Clause H.1/1 Definition => patient
Clause H.1/2 => serving, decline, becomes-unable
Clause H.1/3 => sign, in-effect
Clause H.2 => decide
Clause H.3/1 => lacks-capacity
Clause H.3/2 => determine-incapacity
Clause H.3/3 => disagree, rule-capacity, decide
Clause H.3/4 => withdraw-determination
Clause H.4 => agent-chooses, decide
Clause H.5/1 => diagnose-terminal, terminal
Clause H.5/2 => my-instruction, decide
Clause H.6 => revoke, dismiss.
